\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s1\fi-907\li360\sb120\sa240\sl26\slmult0\qj\kerning28\b\caps\fs24 1.0\tab PURPOSE\par

\pard\widctlpar\sb120\qj\kerning0\b0\caps0 The purpose of this document is to establish and maintain a documented system to control all documents and data related to the requirement of Integrated Management System and:\par

\pard\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sb120\qj\f2\'d8\tab\f0 To ensure most recent revision of documents is available to appropriate personnel.\par
\f2\'d8\tab\f0 To ensure identification, collection, indexing, access filing, storing, retaining and disposing of records.\par
\f2\'d8\tab\f0 To ensure that records are legible, dated, clean, identifiable, and maintained in an orderly manner.\par
\f2\'d8\tab\f0 To identify the storage of records that protects them from damage and facilitates retrieval identification, collection, indexing and disposition. \par

\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s1\fi-907\li360\sb120\sl26\slmult0\qj\kerning28\b\caps 2.0\tab SCOPE\par

\pard\widctlpar\sb120\qj\kerning0\b0\caps0 This procedure is applicable to all type of records being maintained by ABCAK lab.\par

\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s1\fi-907\li360\sb120\sl26\slmult0\qj\kerning28\b\caps 3.0\tab RABCONSIBILITY\par

\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s2\fi-900\li792\sb120\sl26\slmult0\qj\kerning0\caps0 3.1.\tab Chief Analyst / Management Representative \par

\pard\widctlpar\sb120\qj\b0 Chief Analyst/ Management Representative is rABConsible for the implementation of the procedure.\par

\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s2\fi-900\li792\sb120\sl26\slmult0\qj\b 3.2.\tab Lab Management System Coordinator (LMSC) / DMR \par

\pard\widctlpar\sb120\qj\b0 Lab Management System Coordinator (LMSC)/DMR is rABConsible for: \par
Reviewing the validity of records after completion of their retention period.\par
Maintaining Master List of Records and Master List of Files / Folders / Registers.\par

\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s1\fi-907\li360\sb120\sl26\slmult0\qj\kerning28\b\caps 4.0\tab PROCEDURE\par

\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s2\fi-900\li792\sb120\sl26\slmult0\qj\kerning0\caps0 4.1.\tab Record Identification\par

\pard\widctlpar\sb120\qj\b0 ABCAK lab has defined a system for the identification of records used in the lab. The system includes:\par

\pard\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sb120\qj i.\tab Coding Scheme\par
ii.\tab Header Format\par

\pard\keepn\nowidctlpar\s2\fi-900\li792\sb120\sl26\slmult0\qj\b 4.2.\tab Record Coding Scheme\par

\pard\widctlpar\sb120\qj\b0 ABCAK lab has established a record coding system, which is applied to all the records being generated or maintained by Lab. All the records have uniquely identification code. \par
Detail of record coding scheme for \b Laboratory System Format\b0  is given below;\par
\b\ldblquote ABC-AAA-TTT-NNN\rdblquote\par
\b0 Where,\par
\b ABC:\b0     Environmental Services Pakistan\par
\b AAA:\b0  \tab ABCAK Section maintaining Record\par
\b TTT:\b0\tab Type of record, e.g. SAP, ED\par
\b NNN:\b0   Serial Number of Record File, given in incremental order.\par

